---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Us | Bioque Estates International Pvt. Ltd."
  description="Discover Bioque Estates International Pvt. Ltd. - Premier luxury real estate advisory spanning New Chandigarh, Tri-City, and Dubai in partnership with Springfield Properties."
>
  <div class="bg-dark-950 text-white py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-dark-850">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#D4AF37] uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">Our Heritage & Partnership</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black font-display tracking-tight text-white">
        About Bioque Estates International Pvt. Ltd.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2 max-w-2xl">
        Connecting India's premier developers in New Chandigarh and Tri-City with global ultra-luxury waterfront residences in Dubai.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-dark-900 font-display">
          Unmatched Advisory Across Flagship Corridors
        </h2>
        <p>
          Headquartered in Chandigarh on Madhya Marg, <strong>Bioque Estates International Pvt. Ltd.</strong> is a specialized luxury real estate advisory firm. We bridge the northern Indian luxury corridor—including Omaxe New Chandigarh, DLF, and Tri-City high-rises—with prime international real estate markets.
        </p>
        <p>
          In exclusive partnership with <strong>Springfield Properties UAE</strong>, our advisory desk provides seamless transaction execution, site inspections, and portfolio management for NRI and high-net-worth investors looking to diversify into tax-free Dubai assets.
        </p>
        <div class="border-l-4 border-[#D4AF37] pl-4 py-2 italic text-slate-800 font-medium">
          "Every development in our portfolio is selected based on developer delivery pedigree, architectural superiority, and capital appreciation potential."
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="springfield-card p-8 border border-slate-200">
        <img src="https://pub-c9b2fd77f9484acab7c67cf5c62e7d37.r2.dev/logos/68b55a31-a16d-454d-a20f-11adabf590b0-bioque-logo.png" alt="Bioque Estates" class="w-24 h-auto object-contain mb-6" />
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark-900 mb-1">Corporate Advisory Desk</h3>
        <p class="text-xs font-bold text-[#AA8222] uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">SCO 118-119, Madhya Marg, Sector 8-C, Chandigarh</p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-6">
          "We offer end-to-end guidance from preliminary layout evaluations to legal conveyance and property management across India and the United Arab Emirates."
        </p>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500">
          <span>Official Advisory Line:</span>
          <span class="text-dark-900 font-bold">+91 98886 26786</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
